Task 1: Install and Configure Redmine (Lightweight Ticketing)
Download and extract Redmine:
cd /opt
sudo wget https://www.redmine.org/releases/redmine-5.1.1.tar.gz
sudo tar -xzf redmine-5.1.1.tar.gz
sudo mv redmine-5.1.1 redmine
cd redmine
Configure SQLite database (simplest option for single-machine lab):
sudo tee config/database.yml <<EOF
production:
  adapter: sqlite3
  database: db/redmine.sqlite3
EOF
Install dependencies and initialize:
sudo bundle install --without development test
sudo bundle exec rake generate_secret_token
RAILS_ENV=production sudo bundle exec rake db:migrate
Start Redmine on port 3000:
sudo bundle exec rails server webrick -e production -p 3000 -d
Verify: Open a browser to http://<lab-machine-ip>:3000. Login with default admin/admin.
Troubleshooting: If bundle install fails on gem versions, run sudo gem update --system first.

