Task 4: Track Risk Acceptance and Residual Risk
Add a custom field in Redmine (Administration > Custom Fields > Issues) named Risk_Decision with values: Remediate, Risk Accepted, Transferred.
Add a second custom field Residual_Risk (text field) to record the risk level remaining after mitigation.
For finding F-003 (Low severity), set:
Risk_Decision = "Risk Accepted"
Residual_Risk = "Low - accepted by ISSO, review in 12 months"
Document this decision rationale in the ticket's notes/journal field.
Troubleshooting: Custom fields must be enabled per-tracker (Administration > Trackers > Bug > check Risk_Decision/Residual_Risk).

